## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to coordinate API server webhook rollout, CA rotation, and observability without service disruption. Highlights risk detection and rollback discipline.

## Key Concepts

- MutatingWebhookConfiguration
- CA bundle rotation and webhooks
- RollingUpdate strategy
- Canary deployment patterns
- cluster observability and rollback

## Code Example

